---
// Faixa superior de alerta/destaque urgente
---

<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-orange via-amber-500 to-brand-orange text-slate-950 font-sans text-xs font-semibold py-1.5 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis whitespace-nowrap">
      <span class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">
        URGENTE
      </span>
      <a href="/noticias/segregacao-patrimonial" class="hover:underline truncate text-slate-950 font-bold">
        Banco Central avança em novas diretrizes para custodiantes e PSAVs no Brasil →
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] font-mono shrink-0">
      <span>EDIÇÃO DIÁRIA</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">100% FACTUAL</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
